  "bio": "Giulio Cesare, hailing from Montevarchi, Italy, is a highly skilled professional tattoo artist famous for his captivating black & gray, dotwork, and realism styles. Despite his self-described anti-social persona, his work transcends boundaries, earning him international acclaim and guest spots at esteemed tattoo studios like Banano's Family Tattoo and Body Design Gent.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Montevarchi, Tuscany, Italy\n\nSuperior Realism\nL U X U R Y  B R A N D\n-Creator of @minifigures_collectibles\n-CEO @arezzotattooconvention \n-Powered @cnctattoo @inkprogress01 \nWeb ⬇️",
